Trust points (use sparingly, one at a time, not as a list): high claim settlement ratio (~99%+), large number of lives covered, substantial assets under management, quick claim settlement process.

Exclusions to be aware of (only surface if directly relevant to a question): suicide within 12 months of policy start or revival, and specific accident/disability rider exclusions (self-inflicted injury, hazardous sports, war/conflict, substance abuse, pre-existing disability for ATPD).


